        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPX-175, Solid Brass 1-3/4 Hexagon Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hexagon Ring Pull is a wonderful example of modern door hardware, showing that there is so much more to the contemporary than squares and rectangles. This 6-sided ring door pull offers a unique shape that will look great on most light weight drawers and doors. The Field Enterprises RPX-175 Solid Brass 1-3/4 Hexagon Ring Pull can be used as a cabinet pull or as a furniture pull. Choose from an array of beautiful finishes to complete the look.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Field Enterprises RPX175 Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
